{
  "_note": [
    "Rosters for B13: the first two divisions of the top 5 leagues plus Romania.",
    "This file exists because TheSportsDB's league listings are unusable on the free key:",
    "lookup_all_teams.php?id=<any league> returns English League 1 whatever you ask for,",
    "search_all_teams.php?l=<league> caps at 10 teams, ?c=<country> caps at 10 and returns",
    "junk, and lookuptable.php caps at 5 rows. Per-team searchteams.php?t= is uncapped and",
    "is what the fetcher uses, so the club names have to come from here.",
    "",
    "Entries are either a plain string (searched and displayed as written) or",
    "{\"name\": <what to search>, \"as\": <what the card shows>}.",
    "The season is 2025-26. Division membership is not used by the app - it only decides",
    "which clubs get pulled in - so a club that has since gone up or down is still fine."
